      "content": "the sovereignty part is a bit vague though. does it actually matter if a country loses some control over its own laws if it means we stop the race to the bottom on environmental standards? seems like a small price to pay for actually fixing the climate problem. what do u think? is it a legitimate concern or just an excuse for companies to keep polluting?",
